<article class="legal-page section-block"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR PRIVACY MATTERS</span><h1>Privacy.</h1><p>Hot Products collects information you choose to provide in a site review or direct purchase, such as your name, email address and any service notes. Reviews are held for approval before they appear publicly. We do not display your email address with a review.</p><h2>Affiliate links and activity</h2><p>When you follow a partner link, the retailer’s website handles what happens next under its own privacy policy. We count product views and partner-link clicks to understand which finds are useful. This site does not store your full IP address as part of those activity counts.</p><h2>Direct purchases</h2><p>Payments are processed by PayPal when checkout is enabled. We receive payment confirmation and order details needed to fulfil a download or service. Hot Products does not receive your PayPal password or full payment-card details.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For a privacy question about information submitted to this site, contact <a href="mailto:support@techittechnologies.com">support@techittechnologies.com</a>.</p><p>This page should be reviewed and updated to match the final hosting, analytics and payment configuration before launch.</p></article>
